{"id":"4e01b783dda59f5e","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion.md","title":"幂等替换的支持判据","display":"thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion — 幂等替换的支持判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion","aliases":["56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion"],"display":"thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion — 幂等替换的支持判据","depends_on":["[[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]","[[56-df-substitution-application]]"],"source_section":"§7.7 Exercise 7.7.5","source_printed_pages":"293","source_ocr_blocks":[314],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion — 幂等替换的支持判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"94e07ab4a04b0626\" href=\"?note=94e07ab4a04b0626\" title=\"56-df-idempotent-substitution\">56-df-idempotent-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.7 Exercise 7.7.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"293"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>314</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Idempotent},\\operatorname{Introduced},\\operatorname{Dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{Idempotent},\\operatorname{Introduced},\\operatorname{Dom}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"94e07ab4a04b0626\" href=\"?note=94e07ab4a04b0626\" title=\"56-df-idempotent-substitution\">56-df-idempotent-substitution</a>，自由有限项上的替换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6aa7f56f36c897f4\" href=\"?note=6aa7f56f36c897f4\" title=\"56-df-substitution-application\">56-df-substitution-application</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Idempotent}(\\sigma)\\iff\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)\\cap\\operatorname{Introduced}(\\sigma)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Idempotent}(\\sigma)\\iff\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)\\cap\\operatorname{Introduced}(\\sigma)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书练习7.7.5，本轮补本地证明。自由项语法的结构归纳给出 tσ=t 当且仅当t的每个出现变量都被σ固定：变量情形直接，构造器情形由构造器单射和归纳假设。若σ幂等，对每个支持变量x有σ(x)σ=σ(x)，故其像中的变量都不在支持内；反之支持与引入变量不交使每个支持变量的像被σ固定，支持外的变量也被固定，逐变量得到σσ=σ。证明不要求支持有限。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，本轮重新提取文字层后比对上述章节。OCR 页块以 U+001F 分段从1计数，不等同于 DjVu 物理扫描页；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-idempotent-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"94e07ab4a04b0626","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-idempotent-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"94e07ab4a04b0626","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$；$\\operatorname{Idempotent},\\operatorname{Introduced},\\operatorname{Dom}$ 如 [[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]，自由有限项上的替换见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"6aa7f56f36c897f4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$；$\\operatorname{Idempotent},\\operatorname{Introduced},\\operatorname{Dom}$ 如 [[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]，自由有限项上的替换见 [[56-df-substitution-application]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Idempotent},\\operatorname{Introduced},\\operatorname{Dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Idempotent}(\\sigma)\\iff\\operatorname{Dom}(\\sigma)\\cap\\operatorname{Introduced}(\\sigma)=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1700,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion.md]]"},{"id":"28729f9f64189602","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61b740fdfd46bce6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E\\in\\mathcal G$ 且 $\\operatorname{Solved}(E)$；$\\sigma_E,S,\\operatorname{Sol},\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\mathcal G}$ 见 [[56-df-solved-unification-problem]]，幂等性及支持判据见 [[56-df-idempotent-substitution]]、[[56-thm-idempotent-substitution-criterion]]。"}],"outgoing":["94e07ab4a04b0626","6aa7f56f36c897f4"]}